      "contextBefore": "```swift\nvar isAutoVirtualDeviceFusionEnabled: Bool { get set }\n```",
      "contextAfter": "When [`isAutoVirtualDeviceFusionEnabled`](avcapturephotosettings/isautovirtualdevicefusionenabled.md) and [`isVirtualDeviceFusionSupported`](avcapturephotooutput/isvirtualdevicefusionsupported.md) are true, the framework may fuse constituent camera images of a virtual device to improve still image quality, depending on the current zoom factor, light levels, and focus position.",
