      "contextAfter": "**Note**: When using the deprecated [`AVCaptureStillImageOutput`](avcapturestillimageoutput.md) interface with a virtual device, [`isAutoVirtualDeviceFusionEnabled`](avcapturephotosettings/isautovirtualdevicefusionenabled.md) is always enabled, if supported.",
